        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogas Pineas tisiindet, ak bounikab tuiyet, ak kandoikab elfusiekab Israel che kimi koboto inendet, ng’alek che kimwa lagokab Reuben ak lagokab Gad, ak lagokab Manase, kobaibai ichek mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Pineas weritab Eleasar tisiindet lagokab Reuben ak lagokab Gad, ak lagokab Manase, Kaginai rani kele mi Jehovah kwenunnyo, amu mata ochalwogenji Jehovah eng’ kiito: kaosoru anyun lagokab Israel eng’ eutab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiweek Pineas weritab Eleasar tisiindet, koboto bounik, eng’ ole mi lagokab Reuben, ak lagokab Gad, koba eng’ Gilead, agoi emetab Kanan, ole mi lagokab Israel, koipchi ichek ng’alek kogeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiibaibai kioto lagokab Israel; ak kiilos lagokab Israel Kamuktaindet, amata komwa kogeny kole koba kobargei ak ichek, kong’em emet ne kimenyei lagokab Reuben ak lagokab Gad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiguure lagokab Reuben ak lagokab Gad kaptisisionoto, Ed: amu, kile, nito ko baornatet eng’ kwenunnyo ne kagimwa kele Jehovah ko Kamuktaindet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
